	/// Fuel group of each production type. Values: Fossil, Nuclear, Renewable, Storage, Other (unclassified). The five groups add up to total generation. To get the share of any group, filter fuel_category to that group and divide by total generation. Applies only to generation measures; load, prices, flows and weather are not split by fuel.
